# thermo_ea.R -- Shiny module: Thermo EA C/N isotope correction
# Pipeline faithful to R_scripts/251001_Thermo_EA_correction.Rmd
# UX patterns mirrored from appv2.R (Plot ID, outlier checkboxes,
# live red plots, check plots, export layout, sample Area centering).
